  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh my sweet child, I remember that she had made it for her mother when
      she started following the Archaeologist around the village.
  - speaker: 1
    text: The poor man still feels responsible for her death, yet it is indeed this
      monster of a priest that killed her with overwork...
  - speaker: 0
    text: He still seems haunted by this memory.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Like everyone else, Pilgrim.
